; Run this from the kit directory in AmigaShell.
; Requires R115 Pi4, L:fat95 on the actual SYS: volume and a visible FRUM board.
; This is a manual read-only test, NOT automatic boot mounting.
FailAt 20
If NOT EXISTS L:fat95
 Echo "Missing L:fat95 on this AmigaOS installation; nothing installed."
 Quit 20
EndIf
If EXISTS DEVS:pi4usbmass.device
 Echo "DEVS:pi4usbmass.device already exists; check version before replacing. STOP."
 Quit 10
EndIf
If EXISTS SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/USBP4
 Echo "USBP4 already present in SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers; inspect first. STOP."
 Quit 10
EndIf
Copy DEVS/pi4usbmass.device DEVS:
Copy Storage/DOSDrivers/USBP4 SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/USBP4
Echo "Files installed. Running one READ-ONLY mount test."
Mount USBP4: FROM SYS:Storage/DOSDrivers/USBP4
Info
